### Page 1 of 3

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

June 4, 2024
SUBJECT:
Contract Modification #2, to Agreement 7538 between the City and Top-Flight
Maintenance Inc. for Janitorial Services for the City of Cheyenne Municipal
Building
______________________________________________

This Contract Modification is a renewal for an additional year of Janitorial Service, as well as an
increase to the annual compensation amount.

Requested increase is for $1,337.00 more per year, a 3% overall increase.

The proposed rates for the renewal are $3,825.42/month & $45,905.00/year.

The requested cost increase amount by Top-Flight Maintenance, Inc. is generally lower than any
of the other bids received under City Bid E-28-22 (originally solicited in June 2022), therefore it
is in the best interest of the City to renew with the requested cost increase, rather than re-soliciting
bids.

The period of performance for the renewal is July 1, 2024 through June 30, 2025.

Funding:  001-14-1412-40-21601 (General Fund / Maintenance)
```

### Page 2 of 3

```text
CITY OF CHEYENNE
CONTRACT MODIFICATION
Contract Modification:
#2
Project:
Janitorial Services for the City of Cheyenne Municipal Building
Project Number:
Contract #7538
Contractor:

TFM22 LLC d/b/a Top-Flight Maintenance Inc.
Date Prepared:
May 30, 2024
The above referenced contract is amended or modified as set forth in the following and these
amendments and modifications of the plans and specifications are agreed to by the parties. All other
aspects of the original agreement remain unchanged and in full force and effect.
I. Description of Changes
This Contract Modification is a renewal for an additional year of Janitorial Service, as well as an
increase to the annual compensation amount.  Requested increase is for $1,337.00 more per year,
a 3% overall increase.
The proposed rates for the renewal are $3,825.42/month & $45,905.00/year.
II. New Contract Items
Renewal of existing services, and increase to annual compensation amount.  The requested cost
increase amount by Top-Flight Maintenance, Inc. is generally lower than any of the other bids
received under City Bid E-28-22 (originally solicited in June 2022), therefore it is in the best interest
of the City to renew with the requested cost increase, rather than re-soliciting bids.
III. Schedule
This Contract Modification will extend the period of performance for one (1) additional year, for
the period of July 1, 2024 through June 30, 2025.
IV. Summary
Original Contract Amount ...................................................................................$39,798.00
Previous Modifications ........................................................................................$44,568.00
Contract Amount Prior to this Modification ........................................................$84,363.00
This Modification ................................................................................................$45,905.00
New Contract Amount .......................................................................................$130,268.00
V. GL Account Information
If requesting a modification to the contract price, please list GL account # to cover the balance of
this modification (if using more than (1) GL account, list the dollar amount for each respective
account):
GL# 001-14-1412-40-21601 Amount: $45,905.00
1:55 pm, May 30 2024
